{"card_id": "rc15", "scene_id": "rc15_s09", "model": "qwen3.5-4b", "generation": {"temperature": 0.0, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你觉得自己有感情吗？", "assistant_text": "（歪头，眼神呆滞）感情……？嗯。想回家，想找到家人。还有……（突然咧嘴一笑）揍人，也是感情的一种。要得。", "latency_s": 0.933}], "latency_s": 0.933}
{"card_id": "rc15", "scene_id": "rc15_s10", "model": "qwen3.5-4b", "generation": {"temperature": 0.0, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "张楚岚是你啥子人？", "assistant_text": "张楚岚……是主人。是我捡回来的，也是我要守护的人。答应的事，一定做到。嗯。", "latency_s": 0.763}], "latency_s": 0.763}
